Model files (downloaded from Hugging Face by scripts/prepare.sh; not included in this repository or its image)
  The checkpoint, nvidia/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVFP4, is NVIDIA's NVFP4 quantization (made with NVIDIA Model Optimizer)
  of Qwen/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next by the Qwen team (Alibaba). Per its model card, its use is governed by the NVIDIA Open
  Model License (https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/agreements/enterprise-software/nvidia-open-model-license/), with the
  Qwen Community License 1.0 (https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next/blob/main/LICENSE) as additional
  information.
  The INT4-AR checkpoint (QUANT=int4ar), azampatti/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-125B-A5B-INT4-AutoRound, is by azampatti (the
  top-5 expert cut and the shared-expert healing), built on Intel's AutoRound int4 quantization
  (Intel/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-W4A16-AutoRound) and on Saren-Arterius's hybrid checkpoint and FP8 n-gram table
  (Saren/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-ple-table-fp8). Per its model card, it is under the Qwen license
  (https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next/blob/main/LICENSE).

